    "body": "@mtrootyy to my eye that looks correct. html/semantics/sections/headingoffset-and-headingreset.html includes am extensive set of tests which can be used as reference. It's worth pointing out your `<h1 headingoffset=\"7\" aria-level=\"2\">` would match `h1`, `:heading(8)` and `[aria-level=2]`, but the exposed level would be the `aria-level`. ",
